items.stem:
다음 코드를 fetch race condition으로부터 안전하게 만들기 위해 빈 칸 (1)(2)에 들어갈 코드는?

```js
useEffect(() => {
  let ignore = false;
  fetchResults(query, page).then(json => {
    if (___(1)___) {
      setResults(json);
    }
  });
  return () => { ___(2)___ };
}, [query, page]);
```

choices:
```js
useEffect(() => {
  const conn = createConnection(roomId);
  conn.connect();
  return () => conn.disconnect();
}, [roomId]);
```

```js
useEffect(() => {
  window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll);
}, []);
```

```js
useEffect(() => {
  const id = setInterval(tick, 1000);
  return () => clearInterval(id);
}, []);
```

```js
useEffect(() => {
  fetch(url).then(r => r.json()).then(setData);
}, [url]);
```

```js
useEffect(() => {
  const conn = createConnection(roomId);
  conn.connect();
}, [roomId]);
```

